{"4963760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zone//Zero", "steam_appid": 4963760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zone//Zero is a sci-fi first person shooter where you run through mazes that change with every play through. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to run through the levels, shooting enemies and collecting keys to get to the next level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn credits with your kills, level completion, and surviving a level without damage. These credits are used to buy loot crates that give you randomized rewards, including new tech, mods for your existing arsenal, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no save game in the traditional sense, every game is a new playthrough, arcade style. Compete to be the best runner and earn a place on the leaderboards. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zone//Zero is a sci-fi first person shooter where you run through mazes that change with every play through. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to run through the levels, shooting enemies and collecting keys to get to the next level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn credits with your kills, level completion, and surviving a level without damage. These credits are used to buy loot crates that give you randomized rewards, including new tech, mods for your existing arsenal, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no save game in the traditional sense, every game is a new playthrough, arcade style. Compete to be the best runner and earn a place on the leaderboards. </p>", "short_description": "Zone//Zero is a futuristic single player first person shooter. Your objective is to survive various enemies, find keys, modify your weapons, and expand your a